<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank sets two-week rev repo at 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank sets two-week rev repo at 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank offered to drain liquidity on Tuesday through a two-week reverse repo tender with maximum gross yield at 18.5 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The maximum rate was lowered from the 20.0 percent limit on a two-week reverse repo on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
